# SPA build inputs: the image builds these itself (npm ci + vite build in the
# web-build stage), so the host's installed dev dependencies and any stale
# local dist must never leak into the build context. The frontend SOURCES are
# NOT excluded — the builder needs them.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
